# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree,
# overriding core.autocrlf. Development happens on Windows, where autocrlf is
# on by default, but everything this repository holds is read by tools that
# want LF -- Python sources, the manim scene files the pipeline writes into
# each scene workdir, and the concat lists handed to ffmpeg. Pinning it here
# stops a checkout on Linux or CI from reporting every line of every file as
# changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep conversion away from rendered output. The MP4s are gitignored, but a
# demo clip added with -f would otherwise be silently corrupted.
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
